<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1595664358"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:37.333"><div begin="3.088" end="43.800" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="3.088" end="11.752" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.088" end="4.296">夜</span> <span begin="4.879" end="5.602">被粉</span><span begin="5.602" end="6.524">碎</span> <span begin="7.567" end="8.308">霓虹</span><span begin="8.308" end="9.076">陨</span><span begin="9.076" end="9.671">石</span><span begin="9.671" end="10.217">般</span><span begin="10.217" end="10.953">下</span><span begin="10.953" end="11.752">坠</span></p><p begin="13.140" end="22.525" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.140" end="13.601">有</span><span begin="13.601" end="14.612">铁</span><span begin="14.612" end="15.089">锈</span><span begin="15.089" end="15.641">的</span><span begin="15.641" end="16.366">腥</span><span begin="16.366" end="17.222">味</span> <span begin="18.366" end="18.980">世</span><span begin="18.980" end="19.825">界</span><span begin="19.825" end="20.179">似</span><span begin="20.179" end="20.868">是</span><span begin="20.868" end="21.561">而</span><span begin="21.561" end="22.525">非</span></p><p begin="24.547" end="33.419" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.547" end="25.862">美</span> <span begin="26.256" end="26.963">也疲</span><span begin="26.963" end="27.955">惫</span> <span begin="28.922" end="29.584">过度</span><span begin="29.584" end="30.562">闪</span><span begin="30.562" end="31.016">烁</span><span begin="31.016" end="31.573">的</span><span begin="31.573" end="33.419">狼狈</span></p><p begin="34.215" end="43.800" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.215" end="35.119">我变</span><span begin="35.119" end="35.626">了</span> <span begin="35.626" end="36.660">亲爱的</span><span begin="37.022" end="37.692">你</span><span begin="37.692" end="38.833">呢</span> <span begin="39.623" end="40.362">当犹</span><span begin="40.362" end="40.983">豫</span><span begin="40.983" end="42.255">变成</span><span begin="42.255" end="43.101">无所</span><span begin="43.101" end="43.800">畏</span></p></div><div begin="44.488" end="1:29.407" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="44.488" end="49.473" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.488" end="45.989">愿爱无所</span><span begin="45.989" end="46.389">畏</span> <span begin="46.698" end="47.259">把不</span><span begin="47.259" end="47.954">对</span> <span begin="47.954" end="48.666">变成</span><span begin="48.666" end="49.473">对</span></p><p begin="50.836" end="54.824" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.836" end="52.577">紧紧的依偎</span> <span begin="52.577" end="53.879">抱满月入</span><span begin="53.879" end="54.824">睡</span></p><p begin="55.169" end="1:01.064" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.169" end="56.601">有一种绝</span><span begin="56.601" end="57.011">对</span> <span begin="57.315" end="57.862">不</span><span begin="57.862" end="58.998">会</span> <span begin="59.213" end="1:00.613">尽成</span><span begin="1:00.613" end="1:01.064">灰</span></p><p begin="1:01.241" end="1:05.079" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.241" end="1:01.569">这</span><span begin="1:01.569" end="1:02.620">心</span><span begin="1:02.620" end="1:02.969">不</span><span begin="1:02.969" end="1:03.553">会</span><span begin="1:03.881" end="1:04.254">枯</span><span begin="1:04.254" end="1:05.079">萎</span></p><p begin="1:05.834" end="1:10.846" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.834" end="1:07.287">为你无所</span><span begin="1:07.287" end="1:07.730">畏</span> <span begin="1:08.039" end="1:08.568">既无</span><span begin="1:08.568" end="1:09.269">悔</span> <span begin="1:09.269" end="1:09.871">也无</span><span begin="1:09.871" end="1:10.846">愧</span></p><p begin="1:12.209" end="1:16.275" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.209" end="1:13.585">云影暗黑</span> <span begin="1:13.585" end="1:14.569">有星光</span><span begin="1:14.569" end="1:15.289">徘</span><span begin="1:15.289" end="1:16.275">徊</span></p><p begin="1:16.491" end="1:22.413" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"